0 FILE helios-transmission.ldr
0 Helios - Epicyclic transmission
0 Name: helios-transmission.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/helios-transmission.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original Helios design assembled with OpenAI assistance.
0 // New native PlacedModel exported by the unchanged Brickwright serializeModel function.
0 // Application Author is the native serializer default; design provenance is stated above.
0 // Two-stage compound planets combine the central input and carrier into a passive central output.
0 // Active power-split transmission: motor A supplies the main input; motor B turns the carrier.
0 // No custom constraints, collision edits or scripted output poses.
0 // Companion: helios-transmission.bw. Robot Lab Plain; open model, then Code > To blocks.
0 // Reset the complete model before running and before repeating the demonstration.
0 // Kinematic demonstrator; physical assembly, output loading and efficiency are untested.
